================================================================================
BOMS — COMPLETE DATABASE SCHEMA  (v2 — corrected)
Bridal Omnichannel Management System
Modules: platform · finance-core · inventory · procurement · sales · finance-reporting
================================================================================

CHANGELOG v1 → v2  (see specs/review/01-spec-review.md for the full defect list)
  • All document numbers & SKUs are now unique PER TENANT, not globally.      [A1]
  • platform_sequences added — atomic document numbering, no MAX()+1 races.    [A2]
  • platform_exchange_rates added — rate history; documents snapshot the rate. [A3]
  • Build order fixed: Finance-Core precedes Sales/Procurement.                [A4]
  • idempotency_key on every posting document.                                 [A5]
  • inventory: reserve/release REMOVED from the ledger; reservations own       [B2]
    reserved qty; owned_qty (= on_hand + on_rent) drives valuation.            [B3]
  • Weighted Average Cost, held in inventory_stock_balances.                   [B4]
  • Item location removed from the item master; stock is per warehouse.        [B5]
  • Reservation overlap prevented by a DB exclusion constraint + buffer days.  [B6][B7]
  • Deposits are a LIABILITY (finance_customer_deposits), never income.        [C1]
  • finance_cogs_entries added: sale_cogs + rental_amortisation.               [C2][E6]
  • Mixed sale+rental orders; line_type authoritative, header derived.         [C3]
  • sales_rental_claims added for damage / loss / late.                        [C5]
  • Landed cost allocated pro-rata; landed_unit_cost posts to inventory.       [D1]
  • A/R and A/P owned solely by finance_receivables / finance_payables.        [C8][D4]
  • Account balances derived; cached column reconciled.                        [E1]
  • finance_transaction_id on sales & supplier payments — one unified ledger.  [E2]
  • Void = reversing document everywhere (reverses_id).                        [ADR-005]
  • business_date on every posting — unambiguous end-of-day.                   [A11]
  • Website showcase flags removed from inventory_items (module deferred).     [F2]

CONVENTIONS
  • Every tenant-scoped table carries: tenant_id, created_by, updated_by,
    created_at, updated_at.
  • Every POSTING document additionally carries:
        business_date   date not null     -- ADR-011
        idempotency_key uuid              -- ADR-012, unique (tenant_id, key)
        posted_by       FK users(id)
        posted_at       timestamptz
        voided_by       FK users(id)
        voided_at       timestamptz
        void_reason     varchar(255)
        reverses_id     FK <same table>   -- set on the reversing document
  • Every money-bearing row carries: currency_id, exchange_rate, amount_base
    (tenant default currency, snapshotted at posting).                   [E8]
  • Money numeric(18,2) · quantity numeric(18,3) · rate numeric(18,6).
  • UI language / direction from tenants.default_language_id (en=ltr, fa=rtl,
    ps=rtl). No per-page switcher. Create/edit forms are drawers
    (LTR → right, RTL → left).


